  <SequenceName>k__BackingField: 1-3 A
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Ah the classic opening up to your closest friend trope.
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Told you there wasn\u2019t anything special about\u2026"
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Now hold on there, it\u2019s a trope for a reason, the setup for something
      bigger."
  - speaker: 0
    text: "I don\u2019t think you know what a trope is-"
  - speaker: 1
    text: UP-BAP-BAP! Shhhhhhhh...
  - speaker: 1
    text: You hear that?
  - speaker: 0
    text: ...
  - speaker: 1
    text: The negative Nancy is gone.
